    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Yes, I did! It seems that I didn't catch all the details. Where can I get the specific information you want?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T18:01:30.819187+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "What was so bad that you thought I said that in the last message?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T18:10:12.193160+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "So I guess you think that I'm just some dumb, clueless girl who doesn't even understand how to cook.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T18:11:52.849184+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I see, what do you think about it?",
