    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I'm just so glad that you understood what I meant! \ud83d\ude05",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T18:42:02.421808+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'm really sorry that I said something so dumb. It was just my mind getting ahead of me, and I didn't realize what I had said. I can promise to be more careful with what I say in the future. Thank you for understanding, Olivia.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T18:49:41.985004+00:00"
