      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Haha, that's such a cute way to say sorry!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T18:52:18.085271+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "How are you today? You don't have to tell me what's up, I just want to know if there is something that can help.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T18:54:10.649595+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I'm fine, thank you for asking. It's just been a busy week at work.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T18:55:50.073725+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, I see. Just be careful not to overwork yourself again, and enjoy your weekend! Have a nice break.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T19:04:50.937028+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
